装机 user 8/3 拍"会话不可用" BUG 排查 - 仓根 fork 时删了 session.create 端点.

真因:
- 上游 hermes-agent tui_gateway/methods_session.py 真 session.create handler (uuid + session_db)
- wenshu 仓根 web_server.py:17691 gateway_ws 只 dispatch setup.status + setup.runtime_check (R101 修)
- 装 user desktop 调 session.create -> 30s client timeout reject

修法 (PM-direct 自家改, R125 派单 CC 卡 tool budget):
- web_server.py:17766 加 dispatch:
  - session.create: 返 new uuid + 写 ~/.wenshu-hermes/state.db sessions row
  - session.close: 返 closed ack
  - session.resume: 返 resumed ack
- 仿 upstream tui_gateway/methods_session.py 写 (uuid + session_db row insert)

验证:
- py_compile wenshu_cli/web_server.py 0 错
- diff stat: 1 file, 54 insertions(+)

